  "statement": "Let\n\n\\[ \\begin{aligned} S_n&=1-2+3-4+\\cdots\\\\ &\\quad+(-1)^{n-1}n. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nHere \\(n=1,\\) \\(2,\\) \\(\\ldots.\\) Then \\(S_{17}+S_{33}+S_{50}\\) equals:",
